  m_Name: Note_09
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  NoteName: Note to Sullivan
  NoteText: "Luke says he doesn't understand why confinement bothers me so much...
    the routine, \r\nthe constant cold, every day the same, nothing new or different...
    just snow.\r\n\r\nNot all of us grew up surrounded by ice and orders. Viiktor
    promised to help me request \r\na transfer when winter ends."
